        "quote": "The Topeka Planning Commission members shall be appointed within 30 days after the effective date of the ordinance codified in this chapter. The first meeting of the Topeka Planning Commission shall be set in accordance with the provisions contained in TMC 2.225.050 , as amended. The provisions of K.S.A. 12-745 and amendments thereto shall apply to the Topeka Planning Commission with regard to meetings, officers and bylaws.",
